            <ArticleTitle>Pharmaceutical prescribing for children. Part 6. The management of medical emergencies in children in dental practice.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>29-33</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This paper is the seventh in the series on prescribing medicines for child dental patients. Here, the authors aim to describe the medical emergencies that may occur in children presenting for dental treatment and to provide guidelines on their management, with particular reference to the use of emergency drugs.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
